{'symbol': 'KHC', 'date': '2022-06-28 02:00:00', 'title': "KRAFT HEINZ ANNOUNCES AGREEMENT WITH REPSOL IN COMPANY'S FIRST WIND ENERGY INVESTMENT", 'text': "PITTSBURGH & CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE KRAFT HEINZ COMPANY (NASDAQ: KHC) (“KRAFT HEINZ” OR THE “COMPANY”) TODAY ANNOUNCED A 12-YEAR VIRTUAL POWER PURCHASE AGREEMENT (“VPPA”) WITH REPSOL, A GLOBAL MULTI-ENERGY COMPANY OPERATING ACROSS MORE THAN 20 COUNTRIES AND BASED IN MADRID, SPAIN. THIS AGREEMENT IS THE COMPANY'S FIRST INVESTMENT IN WIND ENERGY AND IS DESIGNED TO HELP KRAFT HEINZ ACHIEVE ITS ASPIRATION OF PROCURING THE MAJORITY OF ITS ELECTRICITY FROM RENEWABLE SOURCES BY 2025. KRAFT HEIN"}